WEBVTT

00:00:19.890 --> 00:00:21.830
Everyone, be careful.

00:00:21.830 --> 00:00:23.400
No need to tell us that.

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:25.700
Though we steal, we don't kill.

00:00:25.700 --> 00:00:29.000
That's the code of the
Hakamadare thieves. Let's go!

00:01:00.270 --> 00:01:01.740
Bastard!

00:01:03.910 --> 00:01:06.540
Some new food? Perfect timing!

00:01:06.540 --> 00:01:10.910
I just finished consuming everyone in this house.

00:01:10.910 --> 00:01:12.910
What darkness caused you to become like this?

00:01:12.910 --> 00:01:16.890
Huh? Is that not obvious?

00:01:16.890 --> 00:01:19.320
This world has gone mad.

00:01:19.320 --> 00:01:23.320
Why is the Light Palace blind to my talent?

00:01:23.320 --> 00:01:26.560
That's why you ate up all the people in this house?

00:01:26.560 --> 00:01:29.730
What of it? Is that a problem?!

00:01:29.730 --> 00:01:30.890
It is!

00:01:59.990 --> 00:02:02.530
Boss, was there a problem?

00:02:02.530 --> 00:02:04.530
No. Good work, men.

00:02:04.530 --> 00:02:06.590
All that's left is doing what we always do.

00:02:07.470 --> 00:02:10.610
Listen well! We must be sure to capture these thieves!

00:02:10.610 --> 00:02:12.170
Not only last night!

00:02:12.170 --> 00:02:15.140
The past few days, they have gone to various homes of aristocrats

00:02:15.140 --> 00:02:17.280
and stolen their valuables!

00:02:17.280 --> 00:02:20.350
On top of that, it is rumored that they act like good thieves

00:02:20.350 --> 00:02:23.620
by giving much of what they steal to the people!

00:02:23.620 --> 00:02:25.950
They are truly the enemy of us aristocrats!

00:02:25.950 --> 00:02:29.220
If you find them, you may cut them down without hesitation!

00:02:29.220 --> 00:02:29.790
Go!

00:02:29.790 --> 00:02:30.950
Yes!

00:02:32.390 --> 00:02:33.790
Yasusuke...

00:02:39.330 --> 00:02:42.960
<i>The white lotus flower blooms</i>

00:02:44.340 --> 00:02:49.680
<i>The key to the bright night sky appears</i>

00:02:49.680 --> 00:02:55.320
<i>And now the hazy barrier fades away</i>

00:02:55.320 --> 00:03:00.560
<i>The unstoppable fate of time</i>

00:03:00.560 --> 00:03:05.080
<i>The ever repeating link</i>

00:03:05.660 --> 00:03:12.670
<i>Madder red clouds are swallowed up by darkness</i>

00:03:12.670 --> 00:03:17.910
<i>Swirling desire gives it strength</i>

00:03:17.910 --> 00:03:23.910
<i>A darkness that even provokes this love</i>

00:03:23.910 --> 00:03:25.910
<i>Quick as lightning</i>

00:03:25.910 --> 00:03:29.020
<i>Illusions, show your true form</i>

00:03:29.020 --> 00:03:34.220
<i>Sky, storm violently</i>

00:03:34.220 --> 00:03:39.860
<i>As the fang of steel shines with a golden gleam</i>

00:03:39.860 --> 00:03:49.860
<i>Why do people yearn for love so much</i> <i>their souls become dyed with crimson?</i>

00:03:50.370 --> 00:03:55.910
<i>Protect it to the end!</i>

00:03:55.910 --> 00:03:58.610
<i>Toward the light of the pure white lotus.</i>

00:03:58.610 --> 00:04:02.880
<i>AH... GARO</i>

00:04:01.980 --> 00:04:03.970
"GARO: CRIMSON MOON"

00:04:03.970 --> 00:04:08.970
"SINISTER EVIL"

00:04:09.620 --> 00:04:12.890
Is pretending to be a thief fun for you?

00:04:15.160 --> 00:04:18.770
I'm not pretending. I am really a thief.

00:04:18.770 --> 00:04:19.770
Yasusuke!

00:04:19.770 --> 00:04:23.640
I only aim for the houses of rotten aristocrats.

00:04:23.640 --> 00:04:27.110
We take the treasures they hoard, but we don't take their lives.

00:04:27.110 --> 00:04:28.940
But, well...

00:04:28.940 --> 00:04:31.510
What is it? Be clear!

00:04:31.510 --> 00:04:34.180
If I'm lucky... or is it unlucky?

00:04:34.180 --> 00:04:38.620
If the house I rob has a Horror,
I've been eliminating them.

00:04:38.620 --> 00:04:42.320
I've been properly doing my work as a Makai Knight.

00:04:42.320 --> 00:04:43.660
Do you have a problem with that?

00:04:43.660 --> 00:04:45.830
I'm not particularly chastising you about it.

00:04:45.830 --> 00:04:49.860
So, were the remnants of those Horrors red?

00:04:49.860 --> 00:04:52.230
That's what you wanted to confirm?

00:04:54.000 --> 00:04:57.860
Yeah, it was red. Sinisterly so.

00:05:02.510 --> 00:05:04.640
Please have some fried sweets.

00:05:05.780 --> 00:05:09.280
Yasusuke, is what you said at Inari's place true?

00:05:09.280 --> 00:05:10.950
Yeah, it's true.

00:05:10.950 --> 00:05:15.320
Not just last night. They've been increasing in numbers lately.

00:05:15.320 --> 00:05:18.230
So another aristocrat became a Horror.

00:05:18.230 --> 00:05:21.030
And the color red...

00:05:21.030 --> 00:05:26.370
Does it have to do with the fact that the moon has turned crimson?

00:05:26.370 --> 00:05:27.300
How rude!

00:05:27.300 --> 00:05:28.840
What are you doing to Raiko-<i>sama</i>?!

00:05:28.840 --> 00:05:31.240
You're worrying about what's above you too much!

00:05:31.240 --> 00:05:32.570
Look below you as well.

00:05:32.570 --> 00:05:33.640
Below?

00:05:33.640 --> 00:05:36.210
Who cares what's happening with the moon?

00:05:36.210 --> 00:05:40.210
I'm more worried about the creatures scurrying around on land.

00:05:40.210 --> 00:05:42.550
That is a respectable aim.

00:05:45.490 --> 00:05:48.260
Yasumasa-<i>dono.</i>

00:05:48.260 --> 00:05:51.030
I'm going to talk alone with my brother for a bit.

00:05:54.100 --> 00:05:55.830
How are things, Kintou?

00:05:55.830 --> 00:06:00.030
Yes, we are currently looking into the attacks on the mansions of the aristocrats

00:06:00.030 --> 00:06:01.600
the last few nights.

00:06:01.600 --> 00:06:02.870
Not that.

00:06:02.870 --> 00:06:03.870
Huh?

00:06:03.870 --> 00:06:06.110
The preparations for the moon viewing.

00:06:06.110 --> 00:06:08.510
Are things proceeding without any problems?

00:06:08.510 --> 00:06:10.880
Yes, just as planned.

00:06:10.880 --> 00:06:16.680
However, there are many who believe the red moon may be ominous...

00:06:16.680 --> 00:06:19.790
An unusual moon is an interesting one.

00:06:19.790 --> 00:06:22.560
It is precisely the reason we will have a moon viewing feast.

00:06:22.560 --> 00:06:23.680
Yes!

00:06:25.060 --> 00:06:30.200
I came, thinking to ask
Raiko how you were doing lately.

00:06:30.200 --> 00:06:31.800
I met you sooner than expected.

00:06:31.800 --> 00:06:35.100
You have business with me? That's rare.

00:06:35.100 --> 00:06:37.970
The thieves causing trouble in the capital...

00:06:37.970 --> 00:06:39.940
Are you the one in charge?

00:06:39.940 --> 00:06:42.380
I heard there were people doing things like that.

00:06:42.380 --> 00:06:44.210
Is this your doing?

00:06:44.210 --> 00:06:46.910
Who knows. What if it was?

00:06:47.550 --> 00:06:50.820
I will not forgive anyone who disrupts the peace of the capital.

00:06:50.820 --> 00:06:52.080
I will cut you down!

00:06:54.260 --> 00:06:56.590
Were you not going to become one who protects?!

00:06:57.730 --> 00:07:01.600
I thought you washed your hands of this thievery business!

00:07:01.600 --> 00:07:04.100
Hey! Don't come to conclusions on your own!

00:07:04.100 --> 00:07:06.970
Then show me proof that I am wrong!

00:07:08.070 --> 00:07:10.140
Hey, hey. Give it a rest already!

00:07:10.140 --> 00:07:12.240
That is what I should be saying to you!

00:07:12.240 --> 00:07:13.740
Then, let me ask you this.

00:07:13.740 --> 00:07:15.940
Even if you wear that shiny armor of yours,

00:07:15.940 --> 00:07:18.410
there are people you can't save!

00:07:21.450 --> 00:07:23.280
What about you, Brother?

00:07:23.280 --> 00:07:26.850
You used to be so strong.
You were the one who taught me the sword!

00:07:26.850 --> 00:07:32.360
Why did you toss aside your pride as a warrior and work under Michinaga?!

00:07:32.360 --> 00:07:34.960
Why are you complacently working below Kintou?!

00:07:34.960 --> 00:07:37.670
To protect this world!

00:07:37.670 --> 00:07:40.030
Though I have to close my eyes to various things,

00:07:40.030 --> 00:07:42.500
protecting the peace is of utmost importance!

00:07:42.500 --> 00:07:45.010
Upholding that peace is what will protect the people!

00:07:45.010 --> 00:07:49.780
If cutting me down will help the people, then do as you like.

00:07:49.780 --> 00:07:55.620
Unfortunately, I have no proof that you are a thief.

00:07:55.620 --> 00:07:57.180
For now.

00:08:03.990 --> 00:08:07.800
You're living quite well for a commoner.

00:08:07.800 --> 00:08:10.160
You've received all this charity.

00:08:10.160 --> 00:08:11.970
There's no way you don't know!

00:08:11.970 --> 00:08:15.300
Now, tell us about those thieves!

00:08:15.300 --> 00:08:17.070
Hurry up and answer!

00:08:25.810 --> 00:08:29.220
I-I do not know! I do not know!
Please forgive us!

00:08:29.220 --> 00:08:33.750
No! I will have you tell us, no matter what!

00:08:33.750 --> 00:08:35.990
I believe that is enough.

00:08:35.990 --> 00:08:40.700
Yasumasa-<i>sama</i>. This is an order from Kintou-<i>sama</i>!

00:08:40.700 --> 00:08:44.730
We were told to do whatever it takes to find the thieves!

00:08:44.730 --> 00:08:47.370
Has an official written statement been released?

00:08:47.370 --> 00:08:49.370
W-Well...

00:08:49.370 --> 00:08:52.870
Collecting the valuables that were given out is fine,

00:08:52.870 --> 00:08:55.110
but the inquiry stops here.

00:08:57.610 --> 00:09:00.280
Kintou-<i>dono</i> is doing things too impatiently.

00:09:01.420 --> 00:09:04.350
He must be trying to recover from his failure of the Raise Gate.

00:09:04.350 --> 00:09:07.860
No, that cannot be the only reason.

00:09:07.860 --> 00:09:10.020
What is this about?

00:09:10.020 --> 00:09:12.030
About our next target.

00:09:12.030 --> 00:09:15.730
First, Fujiwarano Yasuchika on Konoe Road.

00:09:15.730 --> 00:09:18.730
Or Fujiwarano Motofusa on North Road.

00:09:18.730 --> 00:09:21.040
Both of them have been using their status in the Light Palace

00:09:21.040 --> 00:09:22.540
to collect a fortune.

00:09:22.540 --> 00:09:23.800
Wait.

00:09:23.800 --> 00:09:25.870
We're not going to do any attacks for a while.

00:09:25.870 --> 00:09:26.910
Huh?!

00:09:26.910 --> 00:09:28.110
I'm going out.

00:09:28.110 --> 00:09:29.540
Boss...

00:09:30.950 --> 00:09:33.650
I'm a little busy right now.

00:09:33.650 --> 00:09:37.120
I'm doing some research on the red moon for Raiko-<i>sama.</i>

00:09:37.120 --> 00:09:38.720
Did you find anything out?

00:09:38.720 --> 00:09:43.390
There is record that the moon had turned crimson in the past.

00:09:43.390 --> 00:09:45.760
Afterwards, a great disaster occurred.

00:09:45.760 --> 00:09:46.690
And?

00:09:46.690 --> 00:09:50.100
It was something that happened before this capital was built.

00:09:50.100 --> 00:09:52.770
I have yet to find any solid facts.

00:09:52.770 --> 00:09:58.340
But I found what you requested quite quickly, Yasusuke-<i>sama.</i>

00:09:58.340 --> 00:10:00.140
Tell me.

00:10:00.140 --> 00:10:05.280
Fujiwarano Nagasuke, Fujiwarano Hirofumi,
Fujiwarano Norinaga,

00:10:05.280 --> 00:10:07.180
and Fujiwarano Kiyotada.

00:10:07.180 --> 00:10:09.820
They all fell out of Kintou-<i>sama</i>'s favor

00:10:09.820 --> 00:10:14.690
and were barred from social advancement.

00:10:14.690 --> 00:10:16.220
Is that of importance?

00:10:16.220 --> 00:10:19.490
No, that's all I needed to know.

00:10:22.700 --> 00:10:25.970
Aristocrats who fell out of favor with Kintou.

00:10:25.970 --> 00:10:29.100
They were all men that I targeted lately.

00:10:29.100 --> 00:10:32.100
And all of them had become Horrors.

00:10:34.040 --> 00:10:37.310
Kintou... Kintou, huh?

00:10:39.880 --> 00:10:41.950
Fujiwarano Hirofumi!

00:10:41.950 --> 00:10:43.380
Norinaga!

00:10:43.380 --> 00:10:44.370
Kiyotada!

00:10:44.370 --> 00:10:47.480
And Fujiwarano Nagasuke!

00:10:49.120 --> 00:10:51.330
This is all because you went against me!

00:10:51.330 --> 00:10:53.960
Heavenly punishment!

00:10:53.960 --> 00:10:56.530
Strange things really do happen.

00:10:56.530 --> 00:11:00.670
Everyone who goes against me continues to disappear.

00:11:00.670 --> 00:11:03.170
I should thank you for your help.

00:11:03.170 --> 00:11:06.970
I cannot lose my status at the Light Palace right now.

00:11:06.970 --> 00:11:08.310
Is that all?

00:11:09.210 --> 00:11:12.510
Is your desire truly so trivial?

00:11:12.510 --> 00:11:14.750
You should aim higher.

00:11:14.750 --> 00:11:18.990
Take down Michinaga and take the Light Palace for yourself!

00:11:18.990 --> 00:11:22.180
The Light Palace for myself?!

00:11:48.550 --> 00:11:50.790
I will not let you off today!

00:11:50.790 --> 00:11:53.120
You must know about the thieves!

00:11:53.120 --> 00:11:56.750
Answer me! If you continue to hide things, I will kill you all!

00:11:58.430 --> 00:12:00.860
Shit! What a guy.

00:12:04.070 --> 00:12:05.400
Stop!

00:12:09.540 --> 00:12:10.870
Brother...

00:12:22.150 --> 00:12:25.390
This cruelty can no longer be considered inquiry!

00:12:25.390 --> 00:12:28.720
It embarrasses me as a member of the police magistrate!

00:12:28.720 --> 00:12:30.060
What did you say?

00:12:30.060 --> 00:12:33.960
Yasumasa-<i>dono</i>, have you gone mad?

00:12:33.960 --> 00:12:36.660
I would like to ask you the same question.

00:12:36.660 --> 00:12:43.070
The string of recent aristocrat robberies have an inconsistency.

00:12:43.070 --> 00:12:44.770
Inconsistency?

00:12:44.770 --> 00:12:47.510
All the aristocrats attacked in the robberies were unhurt.

00:12:47.510 --> 00:12:49.510
But, there were exceptions.

00:12:49.510 --> 00:12:54.580
The masters of certain houses remain missing.

00:12:54.580 --> 00:13:00.620
All of the missing aristocrats were ones who did not think highly of you.

00:13:00.620 --> 00:13:03.320
Even so, the ones who invaded their houses were thieves.

00:13:03.320 --> 00:13:07.860
Murdering an aristocrat and hiding their bodies is a heavy crime.

00:13:07.860 --> 00:13:11.800
That is why we are searching for them so aggressively.

00:13:11.800 --> 00:13:13.700
Unthinkable.

00:13:13.700 --> 00:13:16.340
They have their own code.

00:13:16.340 --> 00:13:17.810
They do not kill.

00:13:19.710 --> 00:13:21.510
Hilarious.

00:13:21.510 --> 00:13:27.180
You praise lowly thieves and try to throw suspicion on me at the same time.

00:13:27.180 --> 00:13:29.350
Fujiwarano Yasumasa-<i>dono.</i>

00:13:29.350 --> 00:13:33.690
Could it be that you are associated with the thieves?

00:13:33.690 --> 00:13:36.190
A criminal who aims his arrow at the Light Palace,

00:13:36.190 --> 00:13:38.290
Fujiwarano Yasumasa!

00:13:38.290 --> 00:13:39.960
Do not lend your ears to him!

00:13:39.960 --> 00:13:42.030
Cut him down, here and now!

00:13:42.030 --> 00:13:43.400
B-But...

00:13:43.400 --> 00:13:46.200
You dare go against my orders?!

00:13:46.200 --> 00:13:48.670
Anyone who disobeys will be judged for the same crime!

00:13:54.480 --> 00:13:55.840
Kill him.

00:14:01.050 --> 00:14:02.820
It cannot be helped.

00:14:02.820 --> 00:14:05.310
Brace yourselves for some broken bones.

00:14:09.990 --> 00:14:11.950
He's being pretty reckless.

00:14:20.070 --> 00:14:21.830
Die!

00:14:23.940 --> 00:14:25.240
Yasusuke!

00:14:25.240 --> 00:14:29.410
Jeez, don't push yourself too much.
You're not young anymore.

00:14:29.410 --> 00:14:32.210
So that is how it is.

00:14:32.210 --> 00:14:36.080
Thief Hakamadare, also known as Fujiwarano Yasusuke.

00:14:36.080 --> 00:14:40.350
You siblings plan to harm the Light Palace together.

00:14:40.350 --> 00:14:41.860
I see.

00:14:41.860 --> 00:14:44.360
Looks like I let myself fall into a trap.

00:14:44.360 --> 00:14:48.130
Kintou! I will not lose to you!

00:14:48.130 --> 00:14:51.230
Kill them both!

00:14:51.230 --> 00:14:54.370
Brother, I'm going to have you listen to me here.

00:14:54.370 --> 00:14:55.740
Hm?

00:14:55.740 --> 00:14:56.570
We're going to run!

00:14:56.570 --> 00:14:58.040
H-Hey!

00:14:58.040 --> 00:14:59.810
Y-Yasusuke!

00:14:59.810 --> 00:15:01.110
Don't let them escape!

00:15:12.150 --> 00:15:14.960
You really got me involved in something troublesome.

00:15:14.960 --> 00:15:18.130
This is because you continue with your thievery.

00:15:18.130 --> 00:15:22.900
So what? Is that how you speak to the guy who saved your life?

00:15:22.900 --> 00:15:28.240
So what? It seems you just admitted that you are a thief.

00:15:28.240 --> 00:15:29.240
Don't know.

00:15:29.240 --> 00:15:31.740
No, you definitely admitted it.

00:15:31.740 --> 00:15:35.310
Why did you provoke Kintou like that?

00:15:35.310 --> 00:15:38.810
I've been looking into him myself.

00:15:38.810 --> 00:15:42.480
But, you know, the Light Palace is already rotten.

00:15:42.480 --> 00:15:44.320
You should just let it rot.

00:15:44.320 --> 00:15:47.250
There are limits to things.

00:15:47.250 --> 00:15:49.290
So, what are you going to do?

00:15:49.290 --> 00:15:52.190
You can't return to the Light Palace now.

00:15:52.190 --> 00:15:54.930
Kintou is involved in this.

00:15:54.930 --> 00:15:57.600
He desperately wants to catch the thieves

00:15:57.600 --> 00:16:02.270
so they take the blame for both the robberies and the missing aristocrats.

00:16:02.270 --> 00:16:03.870
Probably.

00:16:03.870 --> 00:16:06.440
I will bring Kintou's wrongdoing to light!

00:16:06.440 --> 00:16:08.780
I have a good idea where I can find the proof.

00:16:08.780 --> 00:16:09.840
However...

00:16:09.840 --> 00:16:15.350
That proof is hidden within the police magistrate station, right?

00:16:15.350 --> 00:16:16.880
It can't be helped.

00:16:16.880 --> 00:16:19.180
They say once you eat the poison, may as well finish the plate.

00:16:20.790 --> 00:16:24.660
Are you planning on sneaking into the police magistrate?!

00:16:24.660 --> 00:16:26.690
Who do you think I am?

00:16:26.690 --> 00:16:30.060
I'm a thie... I mean, an ex-police magistrate.

00:16:30.060 --> 00:16:32.070
I know the layout inside.

00:16:32.070 --> 00:16:33.200
I will go as well!

00:16:33.200 --> 00:16:34.800
You'd drag me down!

00:16:34.800 --> 00:16:39.040
It has changed a lot since you were there.

00:16:39.040 --> 00:16:41.010
You will need me to guide you.

00:16:43.180 --> 00:16:44.480
If that's the case...

00:16:44.480 --> 00:16:47.070
It looks like we siblings will be thieves together.

00:17:01.100 --> 00:17:03.230
The security is lighter than usual.

00:17:03.230 --> 00:17:07.100
I'm sure they have many officers out to hunt us down.

00:17:07.100 --> 00:17:08.900
Some fortune amongst all the misfortune.

00:17:12.340 --> 00:17:15.710
Nothing. What about over there?

00:17:15.710 --> 00:17:18.510
No, I haven't found anything that's...

00:17:20.080 --> 00:17:21.280
What is it?

00:17:24.050 --> 00:17:26.020
I see.

00:17:30.890 --> 00:17:32.930
Th-This is!

00:17:32.930 --> 00:17:35.360
Looks like we found the proof you were looking for.

00:17:36.860 --> 00:17:39.430
As expected of Michinaga-<i>sama.</i>

00:17:39.430 --> 00:17:42.640
You truly understand the art of elegance.

00:17:42.640 --> 00:17:47.370
Enjoying drinks while admiring such an unusual red moon.

00:17:47.370 --> 00:17:53.080
More importantly, have you heard of Fujiwarano Yasumasa-<i>dono</i>?

00:17:53.080 --> 00:17:54.880
So terrifying!

00:17:54.880 --> 00:17:58.920
For someone of such high status to be involved with thieves.

00:17:58.920 --> 00:18:02.090
--Let me pass!
--Stand down! Stand down!

00:18:02.090 --> 00:18:02.960
Michinaga-<i>sama</i>!

00:18:02.960 --> 00:18:03.990
Stand down!

00:18:03.990 --> 00:18:05.230
Yasumasa-<i>dono</i>!

00:18:05.230 --> 00:18:08.500
You must be crazy to come here!

00:18:08.500 --> 00:18:12.830
I, Fujiwarano Yasumasa, have come to protect this capital!

00:18:12.830 --> 00:18:13.830
Shoot him down!

00:18:13.830 --> 00:18:15.770
Wait!

00:18:15.770 --> 00:18:18.800
Speak, if there is something you wish to say.

00:18:20.120 --> 00:18:21.330
"Above"

00:18:22.180 --> 00:18:24.950
This is a document for you, Michinaga-<i>sama.</i>

00:18:24.950 --> 00:18:30.280
It condemns a certain individual within the Light Palace.

00:18:31.650 --> 00:18:35.960
However, it was stolen before it reached your hands

00:18:35.960 --> 00:18:41.020
and the writer was murdered, by the hands of Kintou-<i>dono</i>!

00:18:43.260 --> 00:18:46.500
That proof was hidden in a certain place.

00:18:46.500 --> 00:18:52.840
Many documents that should have reached you were kept there.

00:18:52.840 --> 00:18:56.480
As well as various mementos of the murdered aristocrats,

00:18:56.480 --> 00:19:01.150
displayed like trophies from successful hunts.

00:19:01.150 --> 00:19:07.150
If you would come and confirm this for yourself, Michinaga-<i>sama...</i>

00:19:07.150 --> 00:19:09.120
I understand.

00:19:19.500 --> 00:19:22.740
So this is as far as I go.

00:19:22.740 --> 00:19:25.600
But I will not go alone.

00:19:25.600 --> 00:19:28.970
Michinaga! Join me in hell!

00:19:40.250 --> 00:19:43.260
Michinaga-<i>sama</i>, please stand back!

00:19:43.260 --> 00:19:44.890
Michinaga.

00:19:44.890 --> 00:19:48.530
Ashiya Douman, the scars on your face...

00:19:48.530 --> 00:19:50.930
Do not say you do not remember.

00:19:52.230 --> 00:19:54.600
What are you talking about?

00:19:54.600 --> 00:19:58.400
Well, no matter. My work for tonight is done.

00:20:00.570 --> 00:20:02.170
Everyone, run!

00:20:04.950 --> 00:20:06.970
Your opponent is over here!

00:20:09.780 --> 00:20:11.120
Yasusuke!

00:20:11.120 --> 00:20:12.920
Leave the rest to me.

00:20:12.920 --> 00:20:15.060
I caused you trouble.

00:20:15.060 --> 00:20:17.090
Same.

00:20:17.090 --> 00:20:19.290
This is as far as our alliance goes.

00:20:19.290 --> 00:20:20.730
Yes.

00:20:21.760 --> 00:20:23.560
I'll be the one...

00:20:25.370 --> 00:20:27.120
...to finish you off!

00:20:59.130 --> 00:21:01.930
An annoying man as ever.

00:21:25.490 --> 00:21:27.860
Minamotono Yorinobu.

00:21:27.860 --> 00:21:30.700
You are now the new leader of the police magistrate.

00:21:30.700 --> 00:21:32.370
Apply yourself faithfully.

00:21:32.370 --> 00:21:34.930
Yes! I will devote myself completely.

00:21:36.940 --> 00:21:38.470
Here they come.

00:21:38.470 --> 00:21:40.310
They're already here?

00:21:40.310 --> 00:21:42.280
They've gotten really fast!

00:21:42.280 --> 00:21:45.770
They have a new leader now.
We can't let our guard down.

00:21:47.660 --> 00:21:48.780
There they are!

00:21:48.780 --> 00:21:50.380
After them!

00:21:50.380 --> 00:21:51.680
That is?!

00:21:54.220 --> 00:21:58.490
Did you see? Could that have been Yasusuke-<i>dono</i>?

00:21:58.490 --> 00:22:01.800
Yasusuke? You must be seeing things.

00:22:01.800 --> 00:22:07.170
That is the thief Hakamadare, who causes trouble to the capital.

00:22:07.170 --> 00:22:11.470
Hurry! We have to pass these treasures out before morning!

00:22:11.470 --> 00:22:12.730
Understood!

00:22:15.010 --> 00:22:18.050
Don't underestimate me, Yasusuke.

00:22:18.050 --> 00:22:20.410
I will chase you down until the end!

00:22:53.280 --> 00:23:01.220
<i>Whilst looking at the filling moon</i>

00:23:01.220 --> 00:23:11.220
<i>Today, as well, I bury these growing feelings</i>

00:23:11.320 --> 00:23:18.370
<i>The skies of fate have split in two</i>

00:23:18.370 --> 00:23:24.370
<i>(Shine upon the darkness) Lead me</i>

00:23:25.810 --> 00:23:30.720
<i>Yearning for the light, I throw out my heart</i>

00:23:30.720 --> 00:23:35.850
<i>I will always be beside you</i>

00:23:35.850 --> 00:23:42.480
<i>So until the last moment of this life</i>

00:23:42.480 --> 00:23:47.660
<i>Let me see this fleeting dream</i>

00:23:51.030 --> 00:24:01.040
"Next Episode: EXTINGUISHED STAR"

00:23:52.450 --> 00:23:53.850
The stars disappear.

00:23:53.850 --> 00:23:56.290
The moon grows redder.

00:23:56.290 --> 00:24:00.160
And the darkness deeper.
